      "raw": "<p>If you want to look into the history of your game in detail (especially useful for figuring out variant unlocks), you might want to look at (and share) your log file.&nbsp; This is a text file that lists every event in the game, in plain english.&nbsp; It includes a lot of redundancy, so it may not be EASY to read, but the information is all there.<br /><br />Finding log files by system:<br /><br />STEAM/Windows:<br />C:\\Users\\&lt;USERNAME&gt;\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Handelabra Games Inc_\\Sentinels<br /><br />iOs:<br />This is a little complicated, because Apple doesn&#39;t like people looking at files<br />* Download a copy of iExplorer from here: https://www.macroplant.com/iexplorer/<br />(It looks like running in demo mode is fine if this is all you&#39;re using the program for, so you probably needn&#39;t buy a registration code).<br />* Go to Apps -&gt; Sentinels -&gt; Documents.<br />* Right-click on log.txt and select &quot;Export to Folder...&quot;<br /><br />Android:<br />Android/data/com.handelabra.Sentinels/files/log.txt</p>",
